===Source===


The source of this word is for the most part, surrounded in mystery. Until recently where an Army infantry man, Sergeant Abbott, found an ancient scripture. This scripture described how there was a young boy, by the name of Joseph Daniel Shiny Hayter. He was reveered as a god among people with Alopecia, these people looked up to Joseph as a God of the Sun, because due to having the same cell structure as a mirror, he was extrememly relective. Eventually the Alopecians killed him because they found out Chuck Norris was in fact the God of everything.